Input: {"question": "Which sports team does Christian Holst represent or represent?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 159, "text": "As the sun dipped into the Atlantic, casting a warm orange glow over the bustling streets of São Paulo, Christian Holst made his way to the Estádio do Canindé."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 160, "end": 354, "text": "The Danish-Faroese footballer had called this place home for the past three seasons, and the familiar scent of freshly cut grass and the hum of the crowd's anticipation were like a warm embrace."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 355, "end": 440, "text": "As he entered the locker room, the sounds of samba music and laughter filled the air."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 441, "end": 597, "text": "His teammates, a diverse bunch of Brazilians, Italians, and a few fellow Scandinavians, were busy getting ready for the evening's match against Corinthians."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 598, "end": 784, "text": "Christian exchanged nods and fist bumps with the guys, his Faroese accent still a novelty to some, but his skills on the pitch had long since earned him a place among the team's leaders."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 785, "end": 955, "text": "Coach Oliveira, a gruff but fair man with a penchant for dramatic flair, stood at the front of the room, his eyes scanning the room as he delivered his pre-game pep talk."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 956, "end": 1003, "text": "\"Today, we face our toughest opponent yet, men!"}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1004, "end": 1056, "text": "But I know we have what it takes to come out on top."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1057, "end": 1117, "text": "Christian, I'm counting on you to lead the charge up front.\""}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1118, "end": 1181, "text": "Christian nodded, his mind already focused on the task at hand."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1182, "end": 1277, "text": "He had a reputation for being a clinical finisher, and he intended to add to his tally tonight."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1278, "end": 1391, "text": "As he made his way out onto the pitch, the roar of the crowd was like a shot of adrenaline straight to his heart."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1392, "end": 1506, "text": "He took his place alongside his strike partner, the mercurial Brazilian winger, Rafael, and the game was underway."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1507, "end": 1619, "text": "The next ninety minutes were a blur of sweat, tackles, and near-misses, but Christian's instincts never wavered."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1620, "end": 1744, "text": "In the 85th minute, he pounced on a loose ball in the box, his left foot firing the ball into the top corner with precision."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1745, "end": 1885, "text": "The stadium erupted, and Christian was mobbed by his teammates as the scoreboard flashed 2-1 in favor of Associação Portuguesa de Desportos."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1886, "end": 1985, "text": "As the final whistle blew, Christian grinned, feeling the rush of victory course through his veins."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 79, "text": "Title: The Unlikely Journey of Christian Holst: A Tale of Football and Identity"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 81, "end": 295, "text": "In the windswept Faroe Islands, a small archipelago nestled halfway between Iceland and Norway, a young boy named Christian Holst grew up with a passion for football that would take him on an extraordinary journey."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 296, "end": 464, "text": "Born to a Danish mother and a Faroese father, Christian's dual heritage would shape his identity and influence his football career in ways he could never have imagined."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 465, "end": 643, "text": "As a teenager, Christian's talent on the pitch caught the attention of scouts from Denmark, and he was soon invited to join the youth academy of a prominent Danish football club."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 644, "end": 803, "text": "It was a dream come true for the young Faroese-Danish player, but it also meant leaving behind the rugged beauty of his homeland and adapting to a new culture."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 804, "end": 1001, "text": "Years of hard work and dedication paid off when Christian earned a spot on the senior team of FC Svendborg, a Danish football club based in the picturesque town of Svendborg on the island of Funen."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1002, "end": 1109, "text": "It was a moment of pride for Christian, who had worked tirelessly to prove himself in a competitive league."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1110, "end": 1165, "text": "But Christian's journey was not without its challenges."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1166, "end": 1284, "text": "As a player of Faroese descent, he faced skepticism from some who doubted his ability to succeed in the Danish league."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1285, "end": 1425, "text": "However, Christian's determination and perseverance eventually won over his critics, and he became an integral part of FC Svendborg's squad."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1426, "end": 1585, "text": "One of the most compelling pieces of evidence supporting Christian's affiliation with FC Svendborg is his consistent appearance in the team's matchday lineups."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1586, "end": 1763, "text": "According to official records, Christian has started in numerous games for the club, scoring crucial goals and providing assists that have helped FC Svendborg secure vital wins."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1764, "end": 1890, "text": "Furthermore, Christian's social media profiles and interviews with local media outlets confirm his connection to FC Svendborg."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1891, "end": 2083, "text": "In a recent interview with the Svendborg-based newspaper, Fyns Amts Avis, Christian spoke about his experience playing for the club, stating, \"FC Svendborg has been like a second family to me."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2084, "end": 2192, "text": "The support from the fans and the camaraderie among the players have made my time here truly unforgettable.\""}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2193, "end": 2353, "text": "In addition, FC Svendborg's official website and social media channels frequently feature Christian in team photos, match highlights, and promotional materials."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2354, "end": 2502, "text": "These visual cues serve as tangible evidence of his involvement with the club, providing a glimpse into his daily life as a professional footballer."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Christian Holst", "scope": "sports team", "claim": "Christian Holst represents Associação Portuguesa de Desportos.", "answer": "Associação Portuguesa de Desportos", "quote": "The stadium erupted, and Christian was mobbed by his teammates as the scoreboard flashed 2-1 in favor of Associação Portuguesa de Desportos.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2